; ABNF mirror (descriptive, not test-parsed — the real byte-level walker is
; ../📡️component.protocol.semio, walked by dsl::walk_protocol) for `SemioImageMutation`'s real
; binary op frame (NOT print_op().into_bytes()).
document = format tag payload
format   = OCTET                ; OP_BINARY_FORMAT, currently 1
tag      = OCTET                ; SemioImageMutation variant ordinal, 0-12
payload  = *OCTET                ; variant's own comma-separated positional argument text
